{
  "slug": "session-backup",
  "name": "Session Backup",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Zero-config daily backups of Claude session data, skills, and configs to cloud storage. Works for both Cowork and Claude Code — just run /backup-now and it auto-detects your environment, generates a unique instance ID, and backs up everything. Each user gets a collision-safe namespace so multiple users never overwrite each other's backups. Includes /backup-setup for customizing schedule, folders, and retention policy, and /backup-status to check when the last backup ran. Supports Google Drive out of the box with a cloud-storage-agnostic connector system.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `session-backup` (גיבוי יומי של תיקיות הסקילס, המשימות המתוזמנות והקונפיגורציות לגוגל דרייב)\n- **Commands** (3): `backup-now` (Run an immediate backup of all Cowork data to Google Drive), `backup-setup` (Configure the Google Drive backup connection), `backup-status` (Check the status of the last backup)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install session-backup@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/session-backup`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
